 ቀበዻ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እስንስ በልበለወን ዱሪ፣","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"አከ ሞቲን ኡልፍና ኦል ገሉፍ ኦል ቀበማ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ሞቲን ኡልፍና ኩን ኤኙ?","poem":1},{"text":"ዋቀዮ ጀባፊ ሁምነ ቀቤሰ፣","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ዋቀዮ እሰ ወራነ ኬሰትስ ሁምነ ቀቡ ሰናዸ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"ያ ከሮተነነ፣ መታኬሰን ኦል ቀበዻ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እስንስ በልበለወን ዱሪ አከ ሞቲን ኡልፍና ኦል ገሉፍ","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"መታኬሰን ኦል ቀበዻ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"ሞቲን ኡልፍና ኩን ኤኙ?","poem":1},{"text":"ዋቀዮ ዋን ሁንደ ደንደኡ ሱን፣","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"እን ሞቲ ኡልፍናት።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/24.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/25.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/23.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}